than any gaming sector play including GALA
            """
        elif score >= 70.0:
            analysis = f"""
🔥 EXTREME POTENTIAL MICROCAP: {symbol}

HIGH-RISK PROFILE:
• Price: ${price:.8f} ({price_potential})
